+   `study-sheet-release.md` exists, and every row in the three `.jsonl`
+   files carries `"secure": "yes"`.
+4. **Ignored run folders.** After step 3, `git -C /tmp/learn-guard-b status
+   --porcelain` should list nothing under `learn/`, and
+   `learn/.gitignore` should hold the one line `*`.
+5. **Review fence.** In repo b, with a `base_branch` in its config and one
+   committed change, run `/djinn:review quick --base HEAD~1`. The fence in
